        <mxCell id="c61" value="&lt;b&gt;The disagreement is concentrated in the late time of Chapter 12.&lt;/b&gt; Of the 3,137 lines on which the paths disagree, 2,243 (71.5%) were recorded after the operation ended; of all 13,913 direct lines, 5,823 (41.85%)." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#FEF5E7;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="224" width="828" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
