        <mxCell id="c67" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 15.6, direct manufacturing time of 2026, the matrix&#x27;s row and column headings sorted by name, without the words Work Center that every name ends with. Outlined: the diagonal, where the operation&#x27;s work center and the time clock&#x27;s agree. Highlighted: Packing operations clocked at Assembly, 4,325.8 hours, the largest cell off the diagonal; 26% of the hours of Packing operations are off it. In the table, True and False read the test SameWorkCenter, and the blank row is the 8 direct lines with no operation, which cannot be tested. Total rows and columns are not drawn, and neither are the other visuals and the text box of the page.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="318" width="860" height="83" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
